SUMMARY:Data Wrangling with Tidyverse - R Ladies Tirane
DESCRIPTION:🚀 Ready to level up your data skills? Join us for “Data Wrangling with Tidyverse” and discover how to clean, transform, and organize data efficiently using the power of R and the Tidyverse ecosystem.\n\n🎤 Speaker: Lule Basha, Associate Professor, Faculty of Natural Sciences, University of Tirana\n\n📅 Data: June 3, 2026\n🌐 Format: Online\n\nWhether you are a beginner or looking to strengthen your data analysis workflow, this session will guide you from 0 to hero in handling messy datasets with confidence!
